{
  "name": "04 · Meeting Booked → AI Pre-Call Brief",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Walk into every call prepared\nPoint a **Calendly** (`invitee.created`) or **Cal.com** (`BOOKING_CREATED`) webhook here, or POST plain JSON:\n```json\n{\"name\":\"Jane\",\"email\":\"jane@acme.com\",\n \"start_time\":\"2026-10-20T15:00:00Z\",\"notes\":\"pricing\"}\n```\nReads their site + your CRM row → Claude writes a 1-page brief with questions to ask → emailed to you. Lead stage becomes `meeting_booked`.",
        "width": 500,
        "height": 340,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "d7b20a0a-9e85-4791-98c6-e4c2ab4f9216",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -380
      ]
    },
